    <bpmn:process id="W_W621" name="W621. Vendor-Managed Inventory (VMI) Daily Performance Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Start of business day; VMI data exchange scheduled execution; performance threshold breach
Frequency: Daily monitoring; weekly performance review; monthly vendor scorecard
Volume: ~300 SKUs from 12 VMI vendors; ~4 DCs; ~200 stores
Owner: VMI Coordinator (within Supply Planning team)
Participants: VMI Coordinator, Supply Planner, Buyer, vendor VMI analyst
Source: workflow W621 — Vendor-Managed Inventory (VMI) Daily Performance Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W621_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W621_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W621_Lane2" name="VMI Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W621_Lane3" name="Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W621_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W621_Start5" name="Start of business day; VMI data exchange scheduled execution; performance threshold breach">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W621_Task6" name="Morning: system executes daily VMI data exchange with 12 vendors — exports…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Morning: system executes daily VMI data exchange with 12 vendors — exports point-of-sale data, current inventory levels, and forecast data per SKU per location; imports vendor replenishment proposals
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task7" name="VMI Coordinator reviews data exchange status dashboard — confirms successful…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VMI Coordinator reviews data exchange status dashboard — confirms successful transmission for all 12 vendors; investigates failed or incomplete data feeds; coordinates with IT Integration Specialist for API issues
Responsible (R): VMI Coordinator
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W621_Task8" name="System auto-validates vendor replenishment proposals against business rules…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System auto-validates vendor replenishment proposals against business rules: (a) proposed quantity within min/max shelf stock parameters, (b) replenishment timing does not create overstock (&gt; 4 weeks supply), (c) proposed items match active assortment, (d) pricing matches contracted rates
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task9" name="VMI Coordinator reviews auto-validation exceptions — approves proposals that…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: VMI Coordinator reviews auto-validation exceptions — approves proposals that exceed parameters by &lt; 20% with documented justification; rejects proposals exceeding parameters by &gt; 20%; returns to vendor with explanation
Responsible (R): VMI Coordinator
Accountable (A): Buyer
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W621_Task10" name="System monitors VMI stock performance: (a) in-stock rate per VMI SKU (target ≥…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System monitors VMI stock performance: (a) in-stock rate per VMI SKU (target ≥ 97%), (b) days of supply per SKU per location, (c) forecast accuracy (vendor&#x27;s forecast vs. actual sales), (d) fill rate on vendor shipments, (e) lead time adherence
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task11" name="For SKUs below minimum stock threshold: system auto-alerts VMI Coordinator and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: For SKUs below minimum stock threshold: system auto-alerts VMI Coordinator and vendor; VMI Coordinator verifies vendor is initiating expedited replenishment; if vendor response delayed &gt; 24 hours, Buyer intervenes per vendor SLA
Responsible (R): VMI Coordinator
Accountable (A): Buyer
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task12" name="Weekly: VMI Coordinator generates VMI performance dashboard — in-stock rate by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Weekly: VMI Coordinator generates VMI performance dashboard — in-stock rate by vendor, fill rate, forecast accuracy, excess stock alerts, data quality score; shares with Buyer and Supply Planner
Responsible (R): VMI Coordinator
Accountable (A): Supply Planner
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task13" name="Monthly: VMI data feeds into vendor scorecard (per W44); Buyer reviews VMI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Monthly: VMI data feeds into vendor scorecard (per W44); Buyer reviews VMI vendor performance in monthly vendor review meeting; discusses corrective actions for underperforming vendors; evaluates VMI SKU assortment for additions/removals
Responsible (R): Buyer
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 1 hour/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W621_Task14" name="Quarterly: VMI Coordinator and Supply Planner review VMI program effectiveness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Quarterly: VMI Coordinator and Supply Planner review VMI program effectiveness — total VMI SKUs, inventory turns for VMI vs. non-VMI SKUs, stockout reduction, working capital impact; recommends program expansion or contraction to Procurement Manager
Responsible (R): VMI Coordinator
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W621_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W621_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W621_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W621_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-249 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Portal &amp; Collaboration (PA-03.4).) | - operational: automated monitoring and IT escalation within 2 hours of detected failure; operational: enriching vendor data with BuildRight&#x27;s own forecast (per W31) and local event calendar; operational: max-stock parameter enforcement in Step 3 and excess stock return policy per vendor agreement
Owner: VMI Coordinator (within Supply Planning team)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
