    <bpmn:process id="W_W870" name="W870. Vendor Compliance Document Upload &amp; Expiration Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor onboarding (initial document submission), document approaching expiration (60-day alert), or regulatory change requiring new documentation
Frequency: ~50–80 document uploads per month; ~30–40 expiration alerts per month
Volume: ~800 vendors × 5–10 compliance documents each = ~4,000–8,000 tracked documents
Owner: Procurement Specialist / Compliance Officer
Participants: Vendor Contact, Procurement Specialist, Compliance Officer, Legal Counsel
Source: workflow W870 — Vendor Compliance Document Upload &amp; Expiration Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W870_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W870_Lane1" name="Vendor Contact">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W870_Lane2" name="Portal System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W870_Lane3" name="Procurement Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W870_Lane4" name="Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W870_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W870_Start6" name="Vendor onboarding (initial document submission), document approaching expiration (60-day…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W870_Task7" name="Vendor uploads compliance documents via portal — required documents vary by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Vendor uploads compliance documents via portal — required documents vary by vendor type: (a) BIR Certificate of Registration, (b) SEC/DTI Registration, (c) Mayor&#x27;s Permit, (d) PhilHealth/ECC Certificate, (e) DENR Environmental Compliance (for chemical vendors), (f) FDA License (for regulated products), (g) Insurance Certificate, (h) PS/ICC Marking Certificate (for regulated products), (i) ISO Certifications (if applicable)
Responsible (R): Vendor Contact
Accountable (A): Procurement Specialist
Duration: 10 min per document</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W870_Task8" name="Automated expiration tracking — portal extracts expiration dates from uploaded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Automated expiration tracking — portal extracts expiration dates from uploaded documents; set 60-day advance alert to vendor and Procurement Specialist; auto-flag expired documents
Responsible (R): Portal System (automated)
Accountable (A): Procurement Specialist
Duration: 5 min (automated)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W870_Task9" name="Procurement reviews and validates documents — verify document authenticity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement reviews and validates documents — verify document authenticity (cross-reference with government databases where possible), confirm document matches vendor legal entity name, and check for required endorsements or amendments
Responsible (R): Procurement Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: 10 min per document</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W870_Task10" name="Issue compliance gap notice — for expired or missing documents: automated email…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Issue compliance gap notice — for expired or missing documents: automated email to vendor with 15-day remediation deadline; if not resolved, escalate to Procurement Manager for vendor suspension consideration
Responsible (R): Portal System (automated)
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 5 min (automated)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W870_Task11" name="Update vendor compliance status — approved documents update vendor compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Update vendor compliance status — approved documents update vendor compliance score; non-compliant vendors flagged in PO creation workflow (warning or block depending on severity)
Responsible (R): Procurement Specialist
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W870_Task12" name="Quarterly compliance report — generate vendor compliance health report: overall…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Quarterly compliance report — generate vendor compliance health report: overall compliance rate, top non-compliant vendors, expiring documents in next quarter, and regulatory changes requiring new documentation
Responsible (R): Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 4 hours quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W870_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W870_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W870_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W870_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-249 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Portal &amp; Collaboration (PA-03.4).) | - operational: registrations — policy exception process needed
Owner: Procurement Specialist / Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
